[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1110","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47913","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用 (Use After Free) 漏洞，受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本。该漏洞位于软件的内存管理机制中，当程序错误地在释放内存后继续使用该内存区域时，攻击者可构造特制的恶意 PDF 文件触发此条件。成功利用后，攻击者能够在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞的利用需要用户交互，即受害者必须主动打开攻击者发送的恶意文件。受影响平台主要为 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已发布修复版本 24.001.30383 和 26.001.21662，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47913"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，受影响用户应立即升级 Acrobat Reader 至 24.001.30383（连续体验版）或 26.001.21662（经典体验版），可通过\"帮助\"→\"检查更新\"自动安装或从官网下载完整安装包覆盖安装。如无法立即更新，建议暂时避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并在邮件网关或终端防护中拦截可疑 PDF 附件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-47913.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c2d7976a30d9a4bb0d098cbb553bce11e610b2f4/2026/CVE-2026-47913.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47913.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1109","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47912","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416），受影响版本包括 24.001.30365、26.001.21651 及更早版本。该漏洞的成因是程序在释放内存后仍使用该内存区域的引用，导致使用已释放内存时发生内存访问违规。攻击者可构造恶意 PDF 文件，当用户使用受影响版本的 Acrobat Reader 打开该文件时，程序在解析文档过程中触发释放后使用条件，导致在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞利用需要用户交互，攻击者必须诱骗受害者打开特制文件才能触发漏洞。成功利用可导致攻击者在目标系统上获得与当前用户相同的权限，进而执行任意代码、窃取敏感数据或进一步控制系统。Adobe 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，受影响用户应升级至 24.001.30383 或 26.001.21662 及以上版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47912"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T21:17:20Z","updated":"2026-07-23T09:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Adobe Acrobat Reader 升级至 24.001.30383（经典版）或 26.001.21662（连续版）及更高版本。可通过 Acrobat 的「帮助」→「检查更新」或 Adobe Updater 自动完成更新。如暂无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的 PDF 文件，并在浏览器及邮件客户端中禁用 PDF 插件自动预览功能，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb26-63.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47912.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5800be5111a4a9084bc37be685bd7d751f884e33/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47912.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47912.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47912.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47912.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8