wl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47911.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-47911.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-47911.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-479xx/CVE-2026-47911.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2b69dd63395ad7510b86e8c698c785b0ea31ab61/content/posts/cve-2026-47911.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2026/CVE-2026-47911.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2026-47911.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0074","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34710","title":"Adobe Substance 3D Sampler 越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Substance 3D Sampler 6.0.0及之前版本存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-787），攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制恶意文件触发该漏洞，导致在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Adobe Substance 3D Sampler 系列软件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。建议用户尽快升级至安全版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34710"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-09T20:16:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:39:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Substance 3D Sampler 升级到 6.0.1 及以上版本（参考安全公告 APSB26-60）。该版本修复了越界写入漏洞。在升级完成前，切勿在受影响版本中打开来源不明的 .sbsar 或模型文件，以防止恶意文件触发远程代码执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/substance3d-sampler/apsb26-60.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-34710.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-34710.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Adobe_Substance_3D_Sampler_%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-34710.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-x35f-42cm-xjh4/GHSA-x35f-42cm-xjh4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34710.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/CNAScoreCard/blob/d2ce8041e79557a609cf010eae5b1eae3dd5bcde/web/data/cna/adobe__CNA-2009-0001.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/902c268f16bea7b5768719502584114b753f22ec/data/analyst/scripts/thr-9b7e98db89fa.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-34710"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1141","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-48565","title":"Microsoft Windows Narrator Braille 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Narrator Braille（讲述人盲文辅助功能）存在非受信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426）。该功能在加载盲文显示驱动及相关动态链接库时，未对搜索路径进行严格验证，导致系统可能从非预期目录加载恶意 DLL。具有本地访问权限的已授权攻击者可将恶意 DLL 文件放置于搜索路径中，当 Narrator Braille 组件启动并加载相关模块时执行恶意代码，从而实现本地特权提升。成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-48565"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T17:17:45Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"通过 Windows 设置安装最新的 BRLTTY 功能更新：依次进入 设置→辅助功能→讲述人→使用盲文显示器→下载 BRLTTY，安装完成后重启系统并确保已应用最新可用更新以修复该不受信任搜索路径漏洞。如无需使用盲文显示器功能，可通过关闭 Narrator Braille 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-48565","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2026/48xxx/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-485xx/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/dd39090b66ba37823c9d39b1b14ea39a58874d96/2026/CVE-2026-48565.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/95dfeac19c1312c71635dbff08ef6b821c8309c0/content/posts/cve-2026-48565.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2026/CVE-2026-48565.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0086","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0086.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47291","title":"Microsoft Windows HTTP.sys 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows HTTP.sys 组件存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-122），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，造成整数溢出进而演变为堆溢出，最终导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，可被用于蠕虫式传播，建议用户立即安装 Microsoft 安全更新以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47291"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-09T17:17:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:54:28Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 6 月安全更新，各版本修复版本号：Windows 10 1607 ≥ 10.0.14393.9234、1809 ≥ 10.0.17763.8880、21H2 ≥ 10.0.19044.7417、22H2 ≥ 10.0.19045.7417；Windows 11 23H2 ≥ 10.0.22631.7219、24H2 ≥ 10.0.26100.8655、25H2 ≥ 10.0.26200.8655、26H1 ≥ 10.0.28000.2269；Windows Server 2012/2012 R2 同步更新。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。如无法立即打补丁，建议在边界防火墙上限制对 HTTP.sys 服务（80/443 端口）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47291","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/1ce02d4d91174b5d6b67423908aa25f065650bbe/2026/CVE-2026-47291.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/Windows%20HTTP.sys%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-47291).md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.06/CVE-2026-47291%EF%BC%9AWindows%20HTTP.sys%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-49160.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-09/TIER_3_CVE-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47291.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-47291/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-47291.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-15.md","https://github.com/dhmosfunk/CVE-2026-49160-CVE-2026-47291-HTTP.sys","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-47291"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0086.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0086.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1018","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-42771","title":"OpenSSL S/MIME 邮件地址验证越界读取拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>OpenSSL 的 X509_VERIFY_PARAM_set1_email() 函数在处理 S/MIME 邮件验证时存在越界读取漏洞。该函数内部辅助函数在验证电子邮件地址本地部分时使用了错误的长度值，导致本地部分的 64 字节长度限制可能未被执行，进而触发越界读取。攻击者可通过在邮件头中构造恶意的 From: 地址，在目标应用进行 S/MIME 消息验证时触发该漏洞，造成应用程序崩溃和拒绝服务。该漏洞仅影响 OpenSSL 的非 FIPS 模块代码路径，不会直接导致敏感数据泄露，但可造成服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-42771"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T17:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"建议将 OpenSSL 4.0.0 升级至 4.0.1 或更高版本以修复此越界读取漏洞。升级后需重新编译并部署所有依赖 OpenSSL 的应用程序和服务。当前暂无临时缓解措施，请尽快完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/6cd187689f8180c1f8a3acde21f88190c4a20de7","https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20260609.txt","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/9c4d2c7bff92e678b88a5964a11c7057925a0bbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2026/42xxx/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/9328bca6ae326ef51038d517f7dc406d0f9acda9/data/2026/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7ed81620937dbbe588ba076b06c9b1f7307f7b38/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-42771.json","https://github.com/google/boringssl/blob/bdc509820b70d8cb81f04f3d91b334b4e2933708/docs/advisories/2026-06-09.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0966","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0966.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-35188","title":"OpenSSL TLS OCSP 装订双重释放漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 的 TLS 客户端在处理 OCSP 装订响应时存在双重释放漏洞。当 OCSP stapling 功能启用且 TLS 客户端连接到恶意服务器时，攻击者可通过 status_request 扩展发送精心构造的 OCSP 装订响应，在证书验证路径中触发双重释放，导致堆内存损坏。成功利用可造成拒绝服务，在特定复杂环境下也可能实现代码执行。该漏洞默认情况下 OCSP stapling 未启用，利用需要客户端主动连接恶意服务器等较高交互条件，但拒绝服务影响易于实现。OpenSSL 已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-35188"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-09T17:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL：4.0 系列升级至 4.0.1，3.6 系列升级至 3.6.3。该漏洞仅影响 OpenSSL 4.0.0 和 3.6.0~3.6.2 版本，3.5 及更早版本不受影响。若无法立即升级，确保客户端未启用 OCSP Stapling（默认关闭），即不设置 X509_V_FLAG_OCSP_RESP_CHECK 标志位，可避免触发双重释放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/131145d25659e8749a9ed1afb383484854cffb78","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/78d0154cffda03aaaac63a087cc523a6b35fa8fd","https://openssl-library.org/news/secadv/20260609.txt","https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/9c4d2c7bff92e678b88a5964a11c7057925a0bbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/35xxx/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/5197f6d88a4fb8976a538beb60d39dd5ad36efed/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-35188.json","https://github.com/google/boringssl/blob/67405dcc8526fd92ee204f744be56790d8b703bc/docs/advisories/2026-06-09.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-35188.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0966.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0056","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-11645","title":"Google Chrome V8 越界读写漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在越界读写漏洞，该漏洞源于 V8 引擎在处理特定 JavaScript 对象时对内存边界验证不足。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，成功利用该漏洞可在沙箱环境内执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Chrome 149.0.7827.103 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Google 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11645"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-09T00:16:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:14:19Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 149.0.7827.103 及以上版本，该版本已修复 V8 引擎中的越界读写漏洞。若使用 Chrome 自动更新，重启浏览器后可在 chrome://settings/help 确认版本。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议在 2026 年 6 月 23 日前完成修复。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中启用安全浏览增强保护模式，并使用组策略限制用户对不可信网页的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/06/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_0153744567.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/506689381","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-11645.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-11645.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11645.json","https://github.com/paladin316/spark-byo-secai/blob/993764caf639dcad891f72ca8b60f6f3cc98d6ba/docs/twpp/examples/Chrome-CVE-2026-11645.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/0c2473c24dfecb383fdaacf2e465a9c66649856e/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_06_chrome-v8-zero-day-cve-2026-11645_html/link.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-11645/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2026-11645.txt","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-06-10.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2026-11645.html","https://github.com/fevar54/CVE-2026-11645-Out-of-bounds-Read-Write","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-11645","https://github.com/adamshaikhma/CVE-2026-11645","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-11645"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0056.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0056.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0378","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52778","title":"YesWiki YesWiki Bazar表单计算器 不安全eval() 远程代码执行和拒绝服务漏洞","description":"YesWiki Wiki 系统的 Bazar 表单字段计算器 (CalcField.php) 存在不安全的 eval() 代码执行漏洞。该漏洞存在于 formatValuesBeforeSave() 方法中，应用尝试通过复杂的递归正则表达式验证用户定义的数学公式后再传递给 PHP eval() 函数执行。该实现存在两大架构缺陷：一是递归正则表达式 (?1)+ 依赖 PCRE 栈处理深层嵌套，攻击者可构造数千层嵌套括号的数学公式触发 PCRE 栈溢出或 ReDoS，导致 PHP-FPM 工作进程崩溃造成拒绝服务；二是验证逻辑在 tokenization 重组后才对 $formula 进行正则校验，若底层 tokenization 函数泄露意外字符串格式，或攻击者利用 PCRE 引擎边缘情况绕过正则，恶意 PHP 代码将直接经由 eval() 执行，导致远程代码执行（RCE），攻击者可获取 Web 服务器权限（如 www-data）实现完全主机沦陷。影响范围：YesWiki 4.6.6 之前版本，影响文件 tools/bazar/fields/CalcField.php。攻击条件：攻击者需具备创建或编辑 Bazar 表单并添加 Calc 字段的权限（通常为认证用户或开放注册场景）。利用方式：1) DoS：提交形如 `((((...(1+1))...)))` 含数千层嵌套括号的公式触发 PCRE 栈溢出崩溃 PHP 进程；2) RCE：若正则校验被绕过，提交 `abs(1) + system('id')` 等 PHP 代码片段经 eval() 执行实现任意命令执行。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8 (CRITICAL)，影响机密性/完整性/可用性均为 HIGH。YesWiki 4.6.6 版本已修复，建议升级并替换 eval() 为安全的 AST 数学表达式解析器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52778","GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-08T19:16:46Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 YesWiki 至 4.6.6 或更高版本，该版本已移除 CalcField.php 中通过 eval() 执行用户公式的不安全逻辑，改用专用数学表达式解析器。如暂无法升级，可临时在 Bazar 表单配置中禁用 Calc 计算字段，并严格限制具备表单创建/编辑权限的用户范围，同时检查 Web 服务器日志中是否存在异常嵌套括号或 PHP 代码注入痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/commit/dd2bd8fb099de0d21504bda8a810693b3fcb8e52","https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/releases/tag/v4.6.6","https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/security/advisories/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2026/CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52778.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/packagist/yeswiki/yeswiki/CVE-2026-52778.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2515f07573bc23c1f79f0d197a09a6f29d3e20ae/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52778.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f15100526750b2cf9bd4dc0cc587f58f968afb29/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-52778/README.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-06-08/TIER_2_CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/fda1b93e4e10d8f7d6b98784e4ad319f13381845/content/posts/cve-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8/GHSA-px5m-h76g-p7p8.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52778.md","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-52778-yeswiki-has-unsafe-eval-in-its-formula-calculato-leading-to-remote-code-execution-denial-of-service.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0745","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0745.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-11393","title":"Amazon AgentCore CLI 代码注入漏洞","description":"AWS AgentCore CLI 存在代码注入漏洞，源于 `agentcore add agent --type import` 命令在生成 Python 代码时对 Bedrock Agent 协作指令的三引号转义处理不当。攻击者可构造包含三重双引号的 collaborationInstruction 值，打破字符串边界并注入任意 Python 代码。该漏洞影响 @aws/agentcore 0.4.0-0.14.1 及预览版 0.3.0-preview.7.0-1.0.0-preview.8。需具备 bedrock:AssociateAgentCollaborator 权限的认证 AWS 用户可关联恶意协作 Agent，开发者导入并运行 `agentcore dev` 或 `agentcore deploy`/`invoke` 时将触发代码执行，分别在本地凭证和 Agent IAM 角色下运行。CVSS 8.8 高危，建议升级至 0.14.2 或 1.0.0-preview.9 并重新生成部署代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-11393","GHSA-m4x6-gwgp-4pm7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-08T19:16:41Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 AgentCore CLI 至 v0.14.2 或 preview 版 1.0.0-preview.9（命令：npm install -g @aws/agentcore@latest）。升级后必须删除已导入的受影响 agent，重新运行 `agentcore add agent --type import` 重新生成干净的 main.py，并执行 `agentcore deploy` 重新部署至 AWS。如无法立即升级，可作为临时缓解手动检查生成的 main.py 中的 collaborationInstruction 字段，将所有三重双引号序列替换为转义等价字符后再运行 dev 或 deploy。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-040-aws/","https://github.com/aws/agentcore-cli/releases/tag/v0.14.2","https://github.com/aws/agentcore-cli/security/advisories/GHSA-m4x6-gwgp-4pm7","https://www.npmjs.com/package/@aws/agentcore/v/0.14.2","https://www.npmjs.com/package/@aws/agentcore/v/1.0.0-preview.9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2026/11xxx/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4e910e4fa4fa60cd85b2b05bafb6fc9b27009a2d/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-11393.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-11393.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/@aws/agentcore/CVE-2026-11393.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/144e072a72718cf976367989b4ef7fcf3f72bd13/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-11393/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-113xx/CVE-2026-11393.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0745.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0752","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0752.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49756","title":"wojtekmach Req 多部分表单数据头部注入漏洞","description":"Req 的多部分表单编码器在构建每个 part 的头部时，直接将用户控制的 name、filename 和 content_type 等字段值拼接到 content-disposition 及 content-type 行中，未对双引号、回车符（CR）和换行符（LF）进行转义或过滤。攻击者若可影响上述任一字段，即可注入 CRLF 序列以插入额外的 HTTP 头部行、走私额外表单字段，甚至追加完整的伪造 part。该漏洞影响 req 从 0.5.3 到 0.6.0 之前的所有版本，尤其在应用通过 Path.basename/1 将用户上传路径派生出 filename 并用于 form_multipart 请求的上传代理或再上传器场景中风险最高，因 POSIX 文件名本身可能合法包含 \\r 和 \\n，使利用更为便捷。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 filename 值，在发出的 multipart 请求体中注入 X-Smuggled 等任意头部或完整的伪造表单域，进而实现 HTTP 请求走私或多部分参数走私，危害下游服务。建议升级至 0.6.0 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49756","GHSA-px9f-whj3-246m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-08T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-23T07:10:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Elixir 依赖库 req 至 0.6.0 或更高版本，该版本对 multipart 表单的 name、filename 和 content_type 字段进行了 CRLF 转义修复。如暂无法升级，应在调用 Req.post/2 的 form_multipart 参数前，对所有用户可控的字段值进行校验，剥离其中的换行符（\\r、\\n）与双引号字符，或改用经白名单过滤后的文件名。对于以 %File.Stream{} 作为上传来源的场景，建议额外对 Path.basename/1 提取的文件名执行 sanitize 处理，仅保留合法文件名字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-49756.html","https://github.com/wojtekmach/req/commit/74506ff2c5addf74df85d79dc726e9b2e264a8ba","https://github.com/wojtekmach/req/security/advisories/GHSA-px9f-whj3-246m","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-49756","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-49756.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/38590de6b24a9e23ae9a8ab63556f3ebbcbcf955/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/908f27ce56b05b89bd69be9a1ba710270fd64008/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/908f27ce56b05b89bd69be9a1ba710270fd64008/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49756.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-49756.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6ffe41ed17f28a5cc4ca179538df7b0072158276/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-497xx/CVE-2026-49756.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0752.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0752.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0092","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49975","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_http2 HTTP/2 Bomb 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_http2 模块存在内存分配大小失控漏洞（CWE-789），在处理特制 HTTP/2 请求时，未对分配的内存大小进行有效限制，导致攻击者可发送恶意构造的 HTTP/2 数据包触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.17 至 2.4.67 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，建议升级至 2.4.63 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49975"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-08T16:16:44Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:36Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.63 及以上版本，该版本修复了 mod_http2 中 HTTP/2 请求导致的内存过量分配问题。如无法立即升级，可在配置中禁用 HTTP/2 协议：在 httpd.conf 中将 Protocols 指令改为 `Protocols http/1.1`（移除 h2/h2c），或在反向代理场景中限制单个连接的最大并发流数量。对于云环境，可在 WAF 或负载均衡层面拦截过大的 HTTP/2 帧作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/06/03/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/06/08/16","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2026/06/msg00009.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25042","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25057","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25090","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25225","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27114","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27200","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27201","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36373","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36831","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36846","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-49975","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2485371","https://github.com/EQSTLab/CVE-2026-49975","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-49975.json","https://github.com/Manisso/http2-bomb","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-49975.md","https://github.com/Kong/kong/blob/cb74f1df5bff05a5858ebb09e75f9b5892a6a940/changelog/unreleased/kong/fix-nginx-cve-2026-49975.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-49975.json","https://github.com/yandex-cloud/docs/blob/f2deb42e097c742df149ae3be26d835122873712/ru/_includes/security/security-bulletins/cve-2026-49975-cve-2026-47774-http2-bomb.md","https://github.com/ninenines/cowboy/blob/702edc6d756952851dad63018f80dbbc7ac8c08c/doc/src/guide/migrating_from_2.15.asciidoc","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-49975%20HTTP2%20Bomb/README.md","https://github.com/patrickmgarrity/Anthropic-Credited-CVEs/blob/1d1ee686a0a7a0601e9ad115149a954b9f1c4299/cves/CVE-2026-49975.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-49975-2026-06-19-0405","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49975","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/1ce02d4d91174b5d6b67423908aa25f065650bbe/2026/CVE-2026-49975.json","https://github.com/mrx-arafat/CVE-2026-49975-POC","https://github.com/fevar54/Proof-of-Concept-POC---CVE-2026-49975-HTTP-2-Bomb-","https://github.com/LSG-PolarBear/CVE-2026-49975","https://github.com/obrige/http2-bomb","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-49975"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0751","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0751.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49755","title":"wojtekmach Req 解压炸弹拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Req 是 Elixir 语言中广泛使用的 HTTP 客户端库，其默认响应管道会依据服务器提供的 Content-Type 头（或 URL 扩展名）自动对响应体中的归档和压缩内容进行解码，并使用 :memory 模式将解压后的完整数据全部加载到内存中，且未设置任何大小上限。攻击者若能控制（或诱导受害者访问）由 Req.get!/1 请求的 HTTP 端点，可在自己控制的服务器上返回一个极小的\"压缩炸弹\"文件，当客户端触发自动解码后，该文件会在内存中膨胀至数百 MB 甚至 GB 级别，从而耗尽 BEAM 虚拟机的内存资源。具体而言，解码逻辑在 lib/req/steps.ex 中的 decode_body/1 函数内实现：当 Content-Type 为 application/zip 时调用 :zip.extract(body, [:memory])，为 application/x-tar 时调用 :erl_tar.extract({:binary, body}, [:memory])，为 application/gzip 或 .tgz 扩展名时调用 :erl_tar.extract({:binary, body}, [:memory, :compressed])，均未对单条目或总大小施加限制。此外，decompress_body/1 函数会遍历 content-encoding 头并链式调用 :zlib、:brotli、:ezstd 解码器，若响应声明多层 content-encoding: gzip，则会无限制地逐层膨胀。上述两个步骤均为 Req 默认管道的组成部分，调用方无需额外配置，攻击者仅需在自己控制的服务器（或通过 Req 自动重定向访问的任意主机）上设置特定的 Content-Type 和 Content-Encoding 头即可触发。该漏洞影响所有使用 Req 默认配置获取不可信 URL 的 Elixir 应用，包括 webhook 发送器、链接预览服务、OAuth/OIDC 发现客户端、包镜像、图片代理以及任何可能跟随重定向到攻击者控制主机的 Req.get!/1 调用场景，无需身份认证，单次响应即可导致 BEAM 进程崩溃并拖垮同一虚拟机上的其他工作负载。受影响版本为 0.1.0 至 0.6.0，升级到 0.6.1 或更高版本可修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49755","GHSA-655f-mp8p-96gv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-08T16:16:43Z","updated":"2026-07-23T07:10:00Z","remediation":"将 Elixir 项目的 req 依赖升级至 0.6.1 或更高版本，该版本引入了解压数据的大小限制，修复了无上限的存档解压导致的内存耗尽问题。在 mix.exs 中更新 `{:req, \"~> 0.6.1\"}` 后执行 `mix deps.update req`。如暂无法升级，可通过 `Req.Steps.decode_body/1` 和 `Req.Steps.decompress_body/1` 从默认管道中移除来临时缓解，或对回调入口限制 content-type 白名单，仅允许信任来源触发存档自动解压，并避免使用 `Req.get!/1` 跟随不可控的重定向链。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.erlef.org/cves/CVE-2026-49755.html","https://github.com/wojtekmach/req/commit/84977e5b1a83f26e749d55ad06e3625464af4e8d","https://github.com/wojtekmach/req/security/advisories/GHSA-655f-mp8p-96gv","https://osv.dev/vulnerability/EEF-CVE-2026-49755","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2026/CVE-2026-49755.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/855cccc669842e07659757dae4f1f3cb3455d986/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/186a108d7b98d98d58bb4a9836ec92c0719dd3c5/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/186a108d7b98d98d58bb4a9836ec92c0719dd3c5/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49755.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-49755.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-49755.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0751.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0751.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0751.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0106","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50751","title":"Check Point Quantum Security Gateway IKEv1 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point Quantum Security Gateway 的 IKEv1 密钥交换协议中存在证书验证逻辑缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 UDP 500/4500 端口发送特制的 IKEv1 认证请求包，绕过用户身份验证机制，在无需有效用户密码的情况下建立未经授权的远程访问 VPN 连接。该漏洞影响 R80.20.X、R81、R81.10、R81.20、R82 及 R82.10 等多个版本系列，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。厂商已发布热修复补丁，建议用户升级至修复版本或禁用 IKEv1 迁移至 IKEv2。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50751"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-08T12:16:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:57:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Check Point SK185033 热修复：R82.10 升级至 JHFA Take 19+，R82 升级至 JHFA Take 103+，R81.20 升级至 JHFA Take 141+，R81.10 升级至 R81.10.17，R80.20.X / R82.00.X 升级至 R82.00.10。临时缓解措施：在 VPN 社区中禁用 IKEv1 并仅启用 IKEv2 协议；限制入站 UDP 500/4500 端口仅允许可信源 IP；对 Remote Access 用户启用强制机器证书认证；监控 VPN 日志中异常 IKE SA 建立及来自非预期 IP 的 VPN 会话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.checkpoint.com/results/sk/sk185033","https://blog.checkpoint.com/security/check-point-releases-important-hotfix-for-vulnerabilities-in-deprecated-ikev1-vpn-protocol/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-50751","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-50751.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-50751.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-50751.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/8dd28f475f4bf0388c11d72954cf88e947236c9